  "disclaimer": "*This % may represent an aggregate of THC/CBD, THCa/CBDa, THCb/CBDb within the product. Consumers should review the actual product label for exact % of THC/CBD.",
  "description": "OMG brings you Mac 1, a premium hybrid flower that's earned legendary status among cannabis connoisseurs. This 3.5g jar showcases dense, frosty buds with a captivating aroma profile blending citrus, earthy, and diesel notes. Mac 1 delivers a beautifully balanced hybrid experience—expect uplifted euphoria paired with deep relaxation that soothes both mind and body. Creative and focused energy makes it perfect for daytime inspiration or unwinding after work. The flavor profile is equally impressive, offering sweet citrus and herbal undertones with a smooth, satisfying finish. Whether you're seeking creative flow, social vibes, or simply relief from daily stress, Mac 1's well-rounded effects make it a versatile choice for any occasion. OMG's commitment to quality ensures each eighth delivers consistent potency and exceptional freshness in every bud.",
